Spinothalamic tracts Secondary (ascending) tracts that convey information 
from the spinal cord to the thalamus for sensations of pain, temperature, 
crude touch, & deep pressure.

Synkaryon Zygote nucleus resulting from fusion of two gametic haploid nuclei; 
a nucleus formed by the fusion of nuclei from two different somatic cells 
during somatic cell hybridization.

